 you'd be like, "Bro, you haven't aged.

1080
00:46:32,700 --> 00:46:33,700
 "What happened?"

1081
00:46:33,700 --> 00:46:36,080
 And then you would look at her and be like,

1082
00:46:36,080 --> 00:46:37,700
 "You haven't aged a day.

1083
00:46:37,700 --> 00:46:40,180
 "You look the exact same now that you did back then."

1084
00:46:40,180 --> 00:46:43,340
 That is not just because my wife is a specimen.

1085
00:46:43,340 --> 00:46:44,420
 She is incredible.

1086
00:46:44,420 --> 00:46:48,100
 It is also because it is hardwired

1087
00:46:48,100 --> 00:46:50,020
 by God's design for women.

1088
00:46:50,020 --> 00:46:52,700
 Like evolutionary psychologists would agree

1089
00:46:52,700 --> 00:46:55,300
 that women have larger eyes, fuller lips, smaller noses,

1090
00:46:55,300 --> 00:46:58,380
 smaller chins than most males.

1091
00:46:58,380 --> 00:47:00,920
 And that as a result, they're more appealing than most men.

1092
00:47:00,920 --> 00:47:02,180
 But here's the truth of the matter.

1093
00:47:02,180 --> 00:47:04,900
 We don't need evolutionary psychologists to tell us

1094
00:47:04,900 --> 00:47:07,940
 that women are more appealing physically than men.

1095
00:47:07,940 --> 00:47:08,780
 And the truth of the matter is,

1096
00:47:08,780 --> 00:47:10,780
 we can just look at our lives.

