 Gentlemen, you bathe with a bottle of Irish Spring,

1107
00:47:36,600 --> 00:47:40,620
 head, hair, face, and body.

1108
00:47:40,620 --> 00:47:42,260
 Well, she's got four products for her hair,

1109
00:47:42,260 --> 00:47:43,740
 three for her skin, and two for her face.

1110
00:47:43,740 --> 00:47:46,100
 And that is not including the bedtime routine.

1111
00:47:46,100 --> 00:47:48,780
 Growing up, gentlemen,

1112
00:47:48,780 --> 00:47:53,020
 you only had to master a stick of deodorant.

1113
00:47:53,020 --> 00:47:56,020
 Some of you still need to master that stick of deodorant.

1114
00:47:56,020 --> 00:48:00,340
 While ladies, they had to learn the nuances

1115
00:48:00,340 --> 00:48:02,920
 of eyeliner, mascara, and blush,

1116
00:48:02,920 --> 00:48:06,020
 and all the other things that I know nothing about.

1117
00:48:06,020 --> 00:48:10,560
 And then lastly, if we were to scroll on your Explore page,

1118
00:48:10,560 --> 00:48:12,700
 gentlemen, what are we gonna see?

1119
00:48:12,700 --> 00:48:15,220
 Women, and if we were to scroll

1120
00:48:15,220 --> 00:48:17,980
 on your Explore page, ladies, what would we see?

1121
00:48:17,980 --> 00:48:22,620
 Women, because women are just prettier than men.

1122
00:48:22,620 --> 00:48:24,660
 Like, it does not take hard science

1123
00:48:24,660 --> 00:48:26,820
 to understand this is true.

1124
00:48:26,820 --> 00:48:28,700
 Now, listen, this is important.

1125
00:48:28,700 --> 00:48:29,860
 It's not even part of the talk.

1126
00:48:29,860 --> 00:48:31,420
 I just need you to understand,

1127
00:48:31,420 --> 00:48:33,140
 because it is so worth mentioning.

1128
00:48:33,140 --> 00:48:35,960
 Why do women struggle with external beauty so much?

1129
00:48:35,960 --> 00:48:42,220
 Why do women wrestle with their God-given appearance?

1130
00:48:42,220 --> 00:48:44,420
 Why do they struggle under it so much?

1131
00:48:44,420 --> 00:48:46,460
 There is so much we can say,

1132
00:48:46,460 --> 00:48:48,140
 and we will, in fact, talk about it.

1133
00:48:48,140 --> 00:48:50,460
 Next week, we're talking about the problems that face men.

1134
00:48:50,460 --> 00:48:51,740
 The week following, we're gonna talk about

1135
00:48:51,740 --> 00:48:52,940
 the problems that face women.

1136
00:48:52,940 --> 00:48:54,040
 And as we get into that week,

1137
00:48:54,040 --> 00:48:57,500
 we will talk about comparison culture,

1138
00:48:57,500 --> 00:48:59,700
 and the sort of snare that that has set

