 Others of you, you have had boyfriends in the past

1149
00:49:26,340 --> 00:49:28,400
 that have just taken you for granted.

1150
00:49:28,400 --> 00:49:35,620
 And still, some of you, you have other men in your life

1151
00:49:35,620 --> 00:49:38,200
 that have just taken advantage of you.

1152
00:49:38,200 --> 00:49:41,180
 And as a result of all of these things,

1153
00:49:41,180 --> 00:49:45,220
 you do not understand how much you're actually worth.

1154
00:49:45,220 --> 00:49:50,060
 And so you are looking to the world to validate to you

1155
00:49:50,060 --> 00:49:52,260
 that you are in fact beautiful,

1156
00:49:52,260 --> 00:49:54,300
 but God has already validated

1157
00:49:54,300 --> 00:49:55,300
 that you are in fact beautiful,

1158
00:49:55,300 --> 00:49:56,340
 that you are in fact worth it,

1159
00:49:56,340 --> 00:49:59,200
 that you are in fact cherishable

