00:49:59,200 --> 00:50:01,620
 because he has sent his son to the cross to die

1161
00:50:01,620 --> 00:50:03,900
 to make that point abundantly clear.

1162
00:50:09,500 --> 00:50:12,020
 But there's more on that in the coming weeks.

1163
00:50:12,020 --> 00:50:14,500
 God has made you with beauty and here's the thing,

