00:51:08,120 --> 00:51:09,300
 Which raises an important question,

1184
00:51:09,300 --> 00:51:10,820
 why does beauty even matter?

1185
00:51:10,820 --> 00:51:12,620
 Like if this is a part of your purpose, why does it matter?

1186
00:51:12,620 --> 00:51:14,180
 Because the truth of the matter is,

