 and yet that space would still be livable.

1190
00:51:21,780 --> 00:51:23,180
 You could live the rest of your life

1191
00:51:23,180 --> 00:51:25,420
 and you could never dress yourself up

1192
00:51:25,420 --> 00:51:26,960
 and you would still be presentable.

