00:51:35,700 --> 00:51:38,320
 So what then is the value of beauty?

1198
00:51:38,320 --> 00:51:41,100
 Because that's a part of your purpose.

1199
00:51:41,100 --> 00:51:44,140
 And here's the value of beauty.

