00:51:44,140 --> 00:51:48,320
 It is the visible expression or radiance of God's goodness.

1201
00:51:48,320 --> 00:51:52,780
 It's the visible expression or radiance of God's goodness.

1202
00:51:52,780 --> 00:51:54,360
 And it is distinctly, it's not exclusively,

1203
00:51:54,360 --> 00:51:57,340
 but it is distinctly characteristic of women.

1204
