00:52:14,440 --> 00:52:16,820
 I don't care about that.

1211
00:52:16,820 --> 00:52:18,740
 That's work for me.

1212
00:52:18,740 --> 00:52:21,700
 Like, I don't wanna roll out there and put flowers in,

1213
00:52:21,700 --> 00:52:24,740
 but she cares because it beautifies the space.

