00:52:50,740 --> 00:52:52,380
 and this actually goes back to creation.

1223
00:52:52,380 --> 00:52:54,700
 This is fundamentally true to men and women.

1224
00:52:54,700 --> 00:52:58,220
 Men, you're designed with the strength to form chaos.

