 Days one, two, three of creation,

1228
00:53:09,060 --> 00:53:11,860
 God puts the necessary structures in place

1229
00:53:11,860 --> 00:53:13,040
 for life to flourish.

1230
00:53:13,040 --> 00:53:16,160
 And then days four, five, and six, he fills them.

1231
00:53:16,160 --> 00:53:18,940
 To the earth, he puts animals.

1232
00:53:18,940 --> 00:53:20,380
 To the sea, he puts creatures.

1233
00:53:20,380 --> 00:53:22,020
 To the air, he puts birds.

1234
00:53:22,020 --> 00:53:25,220
 And to the land, he puts plants.

1235
00:53:25,220 --> 00:53:27,320
 And the beauty of it is,

1236
00:53:27,320 --> 00:53:30,380
 is creation is split in perfect half.

1237
00:53:30,380 --> 00:53:33,540
 One half, the strength to structure.

1238
00:53:33,540 --> 00:53:36,100
 The other half, the beauty to fill.

