00:53:36,100 --> 00:53:39,900
 And then he makes man, and he makes woman,

1240
00:53:39,900 --> 00:53:43,620
 both of which can image him together.

1241
00:53:43,620 --> 00:53:49,000
 This is your purpose, ladies.

1242
00:53:49,000 --> 00:53:50,880
 We are far over time.

1243
00:53:50,880 --> 00:53:52,240
 But I just wanna say this.

1244
00:53:52,240 --> 00:53:55,260
 When I was in college ministry,

1245
00:53:55,260 --> 00:53:59,580
 I remember we would do these evenings

1246
00:53:59,580 --> 00:54:03,420
 that we would commit to guys and girls exclusively,

1247
