 that we'd have guys night, bring in a guy speaker,

1248
00:54:05,300 --> 00:54:07,100
 he would speak to all of the men in the room,

1249
00:54:07,100 --> 00:54:08,500
 and then we'd have girls night, a girl speaker,

1250
