00:54:58,140 --> 00:54:59,320
 But ladies, I think nonetheless,

1268
00:54:59,320 --> 00:55:01,920
 the Father is wanting to speak to you.

1269
00:55:01,920 --> 00:55:03,660
 I think he is wanting to prompt you

1270
00:55:03,660 --> 00:55:07,400
 with sweet and soft and sensitive words.

1271
00:55:07,400 --> 00:55:11,380
 Things that would not unnecessarily,

1272
00:55:11,380 --> 00:55:16,140
 carelessly or recklessly push you in ways

1273
00:55:16,140 --> 00:55:19,080
 that do not lead to your flourishing.

1274
00:55:19,080 --> 00:55:21,660
 He wants for your good.

1275
00:55:21,660 --> 00:55:24,200
 He wants to help.

1276
00:55:24,200 --> 00:55:27,540
 And so for you, whom are called to be suitable helpers,

1277
00:55:27,540 --> 00:55:31,500
 won't you realize Christ was your suitable help,

1278
00:55:31,500 --> 00:55:34,560
 that he did everything and more that we've talked about?

1279
00:55:34,560 --> 00:55:39,040
 That he helped from his strength

1280
00:55:39,040 --> 00:55:40,740
 in the face of our weakness.

1281
00:55:40,740 --> 00:55:45,380
 He nurtured and empowered us by dying our death

1282
00:55:45,380 --> 00:55:46,940
 and rising forth from the dead.

1283
00:55:46,940 --> 00:55:51,620
 And then he has cultivated true beauty,

1284
00:55:51,620 --> 00:55:55,340
 and that he has lit your life aflame,

1285
00:55:55,340 --> 00:55:57,900
 and he is sending you out to make his name known.

1286
00:56:00,300 --> 00:56:02,520
 So if you want to step into your purpose,

1287
00:56:02,520 --> 00:56:07,360
 to help in the way that God has made you to do,

1288
00:56:07,360 --> 00:56:11,820
 know this, you first have to come to his help

1289
00:56:11,820 --> 00:56:16,140
 and receive what he wants to give.

1290
00:56:16,140 --> 00:56:17,820
 Let me pray that you would.

1291
00:56:17,820 --> 00:56:21,540
 Lord, I acknowledge this evening,

1292
00:56:21,540 --> 00:56:26,260
 I felt heavy from the jump for me,

1293
00:56:26,260 --> 00:56:28,020
 from the minute I began to prep,

1294
00:56:28,020 --> 00:56:30,140
 to the moment now that I end,

1295
00:56:30,140 --> 00:56:34,900
 I just have sensed, God, the importance of these words.

1296
00:56:34,900 --> 00:56:39,100
 Not the importance of mine, but yours.

1297
00:56:39,100 --> 00:56:41,820
 The truth, God, of what you want

1298
00:56:41,820 --> 00:56:44,000
 our sisters in the room to know.

1299
00:56:44,000 --> 00:56:46,820
 God, I pray you would keep the enemy

1300
00:56:46,820 --> 00:56:48,180
 really far from this room,

1301
00:56:48,180 --> 00:56:51,940
 that, God, there'd be no space in this space

1302
00:56:51,940 --> 00:56:54,820
 for him to speak, and not a single person,

1303
00:56:54,820 --> 00:56:59,620
 not a guy nor a girl, God, would feel any shame here,

1304
00:56:59,620 --> 00:57:02,300
 because any such shame is the result

1305
00:57:02,300 --> 00:57:05,340
 of the voice of condemnation,

1306
00:57:05,340 --> 00:57:09,380
 but you, oh, voice of truth, you, oh, Christ, our King,

1307
00:57:09,380 --> 00:57:12,220
 won't you speak to us instead?

1308
00:57:12,220 --> 00:57:14,100
 Won't you draw us out?

1309
00:57:14,100 --> 00:57:16,020
 Won't you draw us up?

1310
00:57:16,020 --> 00:57:18,980
 Won't you draw us into you more?

1311
00:57:18,980 --> 00:57:25,840
 You just take a moment, and would you just consider,

1312
00:57:27,820 --> 00:57:31,300
 what is it that the Lord is asking you to do?

1313
00:57:31,300 --> 00:57:36,860
 What's the Holy Spirit speaking?

1314
00:57:36,860 --> 00:57:41,020
 What's the voice of God beckoning?

1315
00:57:41,020 --> 00:57:46,980
 Is it to confess, to walk out of here

1316
00:57:46,980 --> 00:57:48,860
 so very different than you arrived,

1317
00:57:48,860 --> 00:57:52,000
 coming in totally unknown,

1318
00:57:52,000 --> 00:57:54,820
 yet walking away completely known?

1319
00:57:57,700 --> 00:58:02,700
 Is it to lay down your life, to surrender your shame?

1320
00:58:02,700 --> 00:58:08,620
 Maybe you've known him, but you've picked up your old self,

1321
00:58:08,620 --> 00:58:11,180
 and he's asking you to take it off

1322
00:58:11,180 --> 00:58:12,580
 and put on the new instead.

1323
00:58:12,580 --> 00:58:19,180
 Maybe you've come, and you realize

1324
00:58:19,180 --> 00:58:22,220
 some things really need to change in your life,

1325
00:58:22,220 --> 00:58:25,500
 some habits really need to change in your life,

1326
00:58:25,500 --> 00:58:28,460
 some addictions, they really need to change in your life.

1327
00:58:28,460 --> 00:58:31,940
 Won't you let tonight be the night

1328
00:58:31,940 --> 00:58:36,580
 that Jesus can step in and heal what has felt so broken,

1329
00:58:36,580 --> 00:58:38,940
 mend what has felt so bent?

1330
00:58:38,940 --> 00:58:45,180
 Maybe tonight you're here because you haven't known him,

1331
00:58:45,180 --> 00:58:46,740
 but you've sensed over the course of the evening

1332
00:58:46,740 --> 00:58:48,580
 you want to know this.

1333
00:58:48,580 --> 00:58:50,940
 He wants to know you, too.

1334
00:58:51,960 --> 00:58:56,960
 All you need do is reach out the hand of faith

1335
00:58:56,960 --> 00:59:03,260
 and take the hand of Christ as your Lord,

1336
00:59:03,260 --> 00:59:05,300
 your Savior, and your King.

1337
00:59:05,300 --> 00:59:11,300
 We sing to you now, oh, Jesus, meet with us, please.

1338
00:59:11,300 --> 00:59:16,300
 I know this has gone longer than I expected,

1339
00:59:16,300 --> 00:59:21,780
 and yet, God, I think the enemy would have us rush away.

1340
00:59:21,780 --> 00:59:24,940
 So let us not rush, let us linger.

1341
00:59:24,940 --> 00:59:28,220
 The King is here, and he's wanting to work.

1342
00:59:28,220 --> 00:59:29,900
 Let's meet him in the middle.

1343
00:59:29,900 --> 00:59:31,900
 It's in Christ that we pray, amen.

